.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
backend implementation for \fBAI\fP models that communicate with remote Web‑API services using HTTP POST requests\&. 

This backend:
.IP "\(bu" 2
Serializes model input into UserFormat
.IP "\(bu" 2
Sends it to a remote endpoint
.IP "\(bu" 2
Receives responses
.IP "\(bu" 2
Deserializes the result into \fIT\fP 
.PP

.PP
It is designed for free or public \fBAI\fP endpoints that do not require authentication or advanced runtime integration\&.

.PP
\fBTemplate Parameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIT\fP The type of the model's output and raw prompt\&. 
.RE
.PP

.PP
\fBType Constraints\fP
.TP
\fIT\fP : \fInotnull\fP
